<title>USA: Textron Inc Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Textron Inc Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.47		    $0.40</p>
<p> Net			125,000		   35,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,551,000		2,214,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  85,227		   86,680</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q1 1996 results include $74 million charge from discontinued operation. Excluding the charge, net income for that quarter was $109 million, or $1.26 per share.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 1997 estimate was $1.45 per share.</p>
</text>
